############################################################
# 1) 쿠폰 정책 CRUD
############################################################

### 1-1. 쿠폰 정책 생성
POST http://localhost:8085/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyName": "10퍼 이벤트 쿠폰",
  "policyType": "EVENT",
  "discountType": "RATE",
  "discountTargetType": "ALL",
  "discountValue": 10,
  "categoryId": null,
  "bookId": null,
  "validityType": "ABSOLUTE",
  "validDays": null,
  "startDate": "2025-12-05T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2025-12-31T23:59:59",
  "limitedQuantity": 100,
  "minOrderAmount": 10000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 3000,
  "isActivation": true
}

###

### 1-2. 정책 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8085/policies/1

###

### 1-3. 정책 전체 조회 (활성 정책)
GET http://localhost:8085/policies

###

###

### 1-5. 정책 비활성화(삭제 대용)
PUT http://localhost:8085/policies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyName": "삭제된 정책",
  "policyType": "EVENT",
  "discountType": "RATE",
  "discountTargetType": "ALL",
  "discountValue": 0,
  "categoryId": null,
  "bookId": null,
  "validityType": "ABSOLUTE",
  "validDays": null,
  "startDate": null,
  "endDate": null,
  "limitedQuantity": 0,
  "minOrderAmount": 0,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 0,
  "isActivation": false
}

############################################################
# 2) 쿠폰 발급 (RabbitMQ)
############################################################

### 2-0. 웰컴쿠폰정책 생성
POST http://localhost:8085/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyName": "웰컴 쿠폰",
  "policyType": "WELCOME",
  "discountType": "PRICE",
  "discountTargetType": "ALL",
  "discountValue": 3000,
  "categoryId": null,
  "bookId": null,
  "validityType": "RELATIVE",
  "validDays": 30,
  "startDate": null,
  "endDate": null,
  "limitedQuantity": null,
  "minOrderAmount": 0,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 3000,
  "isActivation": true
}



### 2-1. 선착순 쿠폰 발급 (재고 있는 정책)
POST http://localhost:8085/coupons/5/issue
X-User-Id: 10
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 2-2. 이벤트 / 웰컴 / 생일 쿠폰 발급 (재고 무제한)
POST http://localhost:8085/coupons/3/event-issue
X-User-Id: 10
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 2-3. 웰컴 쿠폰 전용 API
POST http://localhost:8085/coupons/welcome
X-User-Id: 10
Content-Type: application/json

{}

############################################################
# 3) 내 쿠폰 조회
###########################################################

### 3-1. 내가 가진 쿠폰 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8085/coupons/me
X-User-Id: 10

############################################################
# 4) 주문 페이지용 쿠폰 검증
############################################################

### 4-1. 주문 페이지에서 사용 가능한 쿠폰 전체 검증
POST http://localhost:8085/coupons/validate
X-User-Id: 10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponId": null,
  "amount": 20000,
  "bookIds": [1, 2],
  "categoryIds": [10, 20]
}

############################################################
# 5) 쿠폰 사용 (주문 완료 시)
############################################################

### 5-1. 쿠폰 사용 처리
POST http://localhost:8085/coupons/use
X-User-Id: 10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponIds": [1],
  "orderId": 999
}


